# ── Exceptions to the blanket *.csv rule above ───────────────────────────
#
# The blanket rule keeps real clinical data out of the repository and stays.
# These two datasets are hand-fabricated (synthetic patient ids, invented
# timestamps — see each directory's README), contain no patient data, and
# are REQUIRED INPUTS, not outputs:
#
# CQ_evaluation/events_data.csv was read by cq_temporal_QA.py for the
# temporal-CQ page of the docs (retired 2026-11-19: those CQs are answered by
# MDA-POC, manuscript Section 4); kept for reference.
!DATA/CQ_evaluation/events_data.csv
!DATA/CAT_evaluation/events_data.csv
!DATA/POC_EVENTS/events_data.csv
# Blueprint identity (device model + label + priority,
# FRAMEWORK/PLAN_blueprint_identity.md): the gateway-name -> model mapping and
# the consensus annotation the knowledge base is built from. Alarm labels and
# expert annotations only, no patient data.
!DATA/ANNOTATION/device_models.csv
!DATA/ANNOTATION/consensus/p75_annotated.csv
# The MDA-POC README is documentation, not output; the blanket *.md
# rule above would otherwise keep it out of the repository.
!MDA-POC/README.md
*_scratch*
*.DS_Store
*.docx
*.pdf

# Local work-in-progress annotation preview (preview_annotations.py) — never committed.
EVALUATION/WIP_ANNOTATION/
